            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.9.9+MAT.9.10+MAT.9.11+MAT.9.12+MAT.9.13"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mt 9:9-13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.5.27+LUK.5.28+LUK.5.29+LUK.5.30+LUK.5.31+LUK.5.32"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Lk 5:27-32",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lino wakazwa lwabili, waya kunkomwe yalwizi, elyo bantu boonse bakali kumutobela, nkabela wakali kubaiisya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.2.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JHN.1.43"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Joh 1:43",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkabela naakali mukwiinda wakabona Levi mwanaakwe Alifayo, ulikede kucitelelo, elyo wakamwaambila kuti, Cilila ndime. Mpawo wakanyamuka, wamucilila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lino naakakede muŋanda yakwe, kwakali banji basimutelo abasizibi ibakakede antoomwe a-Jesu abasikwiiya bakwe, nkaambo bakali banji bakamucilila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.2.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkabela nibakamubona balembi baba-Farisi kuti ulalya antoomwe abasizibi abasimutelo, bakaambila basikwiiya bakwe kuti, Ma! ulalya akunywa abasimutelo abasizibi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.2.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 2:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amvwe buyo, Jesu wabaambila kuti, Bantu baumi embo mbibayanda musilisi pe, pele balwazi. Nsizide kuzookoba baluleme pele basizibi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.2.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
